The '''snugstone spell''' <small>(unofficial name)</small> is a fire-type spell invented by [[Olruggio]] which radiates warmth.

==Description==
The spell consists of a fire sigil, backwards column keystones, and a radial keystone. It radiates warmth outward without the need for a flame{{ref|m|18|20}} and is used on the [[snugstone]], an item used to keep you warm while you sleep.

==Usage==
This spell was first seen drawn on the snugstones that Olruggio gave to [[Qifrey]] and his aprentices so they could sleep better. {{Ref|m|18|21}}

